"autogenerated names. All stored naming formats and related metadata are "
"displayed in the Autogenerated Name Metadata section on the 'Manage Breeding "
"Programs' page. The link for adding Autogenerated Name Metadata can be found "
"on both the 'Manage Breeding Programs' page and on the 'Manage "
"Transformations' page."
msgstr ""
"يمكن لكل برنامج تربية حفظ مجموعات متعددة من تنسيقات الأسماء المولدة تلقائيا. "
